  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "The data was alarming.",
      "startSeconds": 0,
      "durationSeconds": 2.175
    },
    {
      "text": "In their year-long bee monitoring project, Ms. Okafor's 7th grade class found that pollinator visits to the school grounds had dropped by 35% compared to records from five years ago.",
      "startSeconds": 2.475,
      "durationSeconds": 13.25
    },
    {
      "text": "\"If bees disappear, so does a third of our food supply,\" said Marcus, looking up from his spreadsheet.",
      "startSeconds": 16.025,
      "durationSeconds": 6.5
    },
    {
      "text": "The class sat in stunned silence.",
      "startSeconds": 22.825,
      "durationSeconds": 2.4
    },
    {
      "text": "But then Ms. Okafor shared research from the University of Sussex showing that even small wildflower patches in urban areas can increase bee populations by up to 25% within a single growing season.",
      "startSeconds": 25.925,
      "durationSeconds": 14.55
    },
    {
      "text": "\"The science is clear,\" she said.",
      "startSeconds": 40.775,
      "durationSeconds": 2.525
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Small actions can have measurable impact.\"",
      "startSeconds": 43.6,
      "durationSeconds": 3.275
    },
    {
      "text": "The class developed a three-part plan.",
      "startSeconds": 47.575,
      "durationSeconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "text": "First, they mapped every green space within a mile of the school.",
      "startSeconds": 50.675,
      "durationSeconds": 4.025
    },
    {
      "text": "Second, they identified native wildflower species that bloom at different times to provide year-round food for pollinators.",
      "startSeconds": 55,
      "durationSeconds": 8.625
    },
    {
      "text": "Third, they wrote grant applications to three local businesses to fund seed and supplies.",
      "startSeconds": 63.925,
      "durationSeconds": 6.325
    },
    {
      "text": "Two of the three grants were approved.",
      "startSeconds": 70.95,
      "durationSeconds": 2.625
    },
    {
      "text": "Over the next semester, students planted six pollinator patches across the neighborhood.",
      "startSeconds": 73.875,
      "durationSeconds": 5.675
    },
    {
      "text": "Their spring monitoring showed a 20% increase in bee visits.",
      "startSeconds": 79.85,
      "durationSeconds": 4.475
    },
    {
      "text": "The local newspaper covered their project, and two other schools reached out to replicate it.",
      "startSeconds": 84.625,
      "durationSeconds": 5.95
    }
  ],
